    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test the distinction between National Parks (no human activity allowed) and Wildlife Sanctuaries (limited rights permitted).",
        "The enactment year of the Wildlife Protection Act (1972) and the launch of Project Tiger (1973) are recurring exam facts.",
        "Jim Corbett National Park (established in 1936 as Hailey National Park) is frequently asked as India's first National Park."
      ],
